<figure class="figure">
  <figcaption class="figure-head">Architecture, as built</figcaption>
  <div class="figure-body">
  <svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 920 340" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-labelledby="dg-inc-t dg-inc-d">
    <title id="dg-inc-t">Incident-investigation agent architecture</title>
    <desc id="dg-inc-d">An incident ID enters a planner, which dispatches tasks to an executor. The executor calls MCP tool servers — Azure Data Explorer queries, incident and ticket APIs, job monitoring, and the data-stream platform — and returns results to the planner, which synthesizes a confidence-scored, grounded report. The whole loop runs with context compaction, concurrent dispatch, retry under 429 storms, and full LLM tracing.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="arr3" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z"/></marker>
      <marker id="arr3-muted" class="muted" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z"/></marker>
    </defs>
    <rect class="wrap-rect" x="20" y="32" width="880" height="278" rx="10"/>
    <text class="wrap-label" x="36" y="24">CONTEXT COMPACTION · CONCURRENT DISPATCH · 429 RETRY · LLM TRACING</text>
    <g>
      <rect class="node-box" x="44" y="141" width="120" height="58" rx="8"/>
      <text class="node-label" x="104" y="166" text-anchor="middle">Incident ID</text>
      <text class="node-label sub" x="104" y="184" text-anchor="middle">POST /agent</text>
    </g>
    <g>
      <rect class="node-box primary" x="204" y="72" width="196" height="84" rx="10"/>
      <text class="node-label tag" x="302" y="94" text-anchor="middle">PLANNER</text>
      <text class="node-label" x="302" y="114" text-anchor="middle">high-reasoning · 40 turns</text>
      <text class="node-label sub" x="302" y="132" text-anchor="middle">routes · summarizes</text>
      <text class="node-label sub" x="302" y="147" text-anchor="middle">holds long context</text>
    </g>
    <g>
      <rect class="node-box primary" x="204" y="196" width="196" height="84" rx="10"/>
      <text class="node-label tag" x="302" y="218" text-anchor="middle">EXECUTOR</text>
      <text class="node-label" x="302" y="238" text-anchor="middle">lightweight · 12 turns</text>
      <text class="node-label sub" x="302" y="256" text-anchor="middle">fresh context per task</text>
      <text class="node-label sub" x="302" y="271" text-anchor="middle">concurrent dispatch</text>
    </g>
    <g>
      <rect class="node-box" x="455" y="128" width="180" height="152" rx="8"/>
      <text class="node-label tag" x="545" y="148" text-anchor="middle">MCP TOOL SERVERS</text>
      <text class="node-label sub" x="545" y="166" text-anchor="middle">10 tools · managed identity</text>
      <text class="node-label sub" x="476" y="191">· Azure Data Explorer query</text>
      <text class="node-label sub" x="476" y="209">· Incident / ticket APIs</text>
      <text class="node-label sub" x="476" y="227">· Job monitoring</text>
      <text class="node-label sub" x="476" y="245">· Data-stream platform</text>
      <text class="node-label sub" x="545" y="266" text-anchor="middle">reused by Copilot · VS Code</text>
    </g>
    <g>
      <rect class="node-box primary" x="692" y="120" width="188" height="96" rx="10"/>
      <text class="node-label tag" x="786" y="142" text-anchor="middle">REPORT</text>
      <text class="node-label" x="786" y="162" text-anchor="middle">structured Markdown</text>
      <text class="node-label sub" x="786" y="180" text-anchor="middle">confidence-scored</text>
      <text class="node-label sub" x="786" y="195" text-anchor="middle">grounded · classified</text>
      <text class="node-label sub" x="786" y="210" text-anchor="middle">trace → Azure Data Explorer</text>
    </g>
    <path class="flow-line accent" d="M 164 170 H 184 V 114 H 200" marker-end="url(#arr3)"/>
    <path class="flow-line accent" d="M 290 156 V 192" marker-end="url(#arr3)" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/>
    <path class="flow-line" d="M 314 196 V 160" marker-end="url(#arr3-muted)"/>
    <text class="diag-note g" x="324" y="172">execute_task</text>
    <text class="diag-note" x="324" y="188">results</text>
    <path class="flow-line accent" d="M 400 218 H 451" marker-end="url(#arr3)"/>
    <path class="flow-line" d="M 455 258 H 404" marker-end="url(#arr3-muted)"/>
    <path class="flow-line accent" d="M 400 96 H 786 V 116" marker-end="url(#arr3)"/>
    <text class="diag-note g" x="560" y="88" text-anchor="middle">synthesized report</text>
  </svg>
  <ol class="flow-text" aria-hidden="true">
    <li><strong>Incident ID</strong> arrives (POST /agent).</li>
    <li><strong>Planner</strong> — high-reasoning, 40 turns — forms hypotheses and dispatches tasks.</li>
    <li><strong>Executor</strong> — lightweight, fresh context per task — runs them concurrently.</li>
    <li><strong>MCP tool servers</strong> — 10 tools: Azure Data Explorer queries, incident and ticket APIs, job monitoring, the data-stream platform.</li>
    <li><strong>Report</strong> — structured, confidence-scored, grounded; every claim traced to a query.</li>
  </ol>
  </div>
</figure>
